   "text": "In all: 13 of the 27 minutes were tunnels coming up; about 2.5 minutes were data.\nAt 1 GiB the cost is per pod; at 500 GB it would be the bandwidth: 2 to 3.5 hours each time the data crosses the tunnel.",
